{
  "uid": "sap-gw-user-usage",
  "title": "SAP Gateway · Uso por usuário",
  "description": "Quem usou quais rotas e operações SOAP. Baseado em LOGS e TRACES (nunca em métricas): username é structured metadata no Loki e enduser.id nos spans.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": [
    "sap-gateway"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_LOKI",
        "label": "Loki",
        "query": "loki",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Loki",
          "value": "loki"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_TEMPO",
        "label": "Tempo",
        "query": "tempo",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Tempo",
          "value": "tempo"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_PROM",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "username",
        "label": "Usuário (regex)",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".*",
            "value": ".*"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "route",
        "label": "Rota (regex)",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".*",
            "value": ".*"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "Dashboards SAP Gateway",
      "tags": [
        "sap-gateway"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como usar",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Dados pessoais:** `username` identifica pessoas; restrinja o acesso a este dashboard e respeite a retenção definida (Loki 7 dias neste ambiente).  \nFiltre pelo campo **Usuário (regex)** — ex.: `alice` ou `alice|bob`. Em um log, o link **Abrir trace** (campo `trace_id`) leva ao trace completo, inclusive às chamadas SOAP."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Usuários que mais utilizam a API",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (username) (count_over_time({service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} |= \"http request completed\" | username=~\"$username\" | username!=\"\" [$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{username}}",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-BlPu"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "top",
        "minVizHeight": 18,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "sizing": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por usuário",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (username) (count_over_time({service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} |= \"http request completed\" | username=~\"$username\" | username!=\"\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{username}}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Rotas acessadas por usuário",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (username, http_request_method, http_route) (count_over_time({service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} |= \"http request completed\" | username=~\"$username\" | username!=\"\" | http_route=~\"$route\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "requisições",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "requisições",
              "username": "usuário",
              "http_request_method": "método",
              "http_route": "rota"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Operações SOAP executadas por usuário",
      "description": "",
